# Brush Hour (levels/solo/brush.txt): down the stair-well's brush-tipped ledges, along the belts,
# up the fan relays; then the gallery (hop the posts, onto the tall one and off; low hops onto
# the low posts under the ceiling fans), down the drain's belt ledges and through the wash; then
# the long drain: grab the four nuggets, Down (fired up), and one long flat jump (a little toot,
# under the brushes) over the bottomless drain to the plunger.
wait 0.3
hold Right 0.75
wait 0.5
repeat 3
hold Right Space 100ms
hold Right 0.2
wait 0.3
hold Left Space 100ms
hold Left 0.2
wait 0.3
end
hold Right 0.9
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.25
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.4
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.7
wait 0.4
hold Right 0.2
wait 0.4
hold Left 0.2
wait 0.4
hold Right 0.2
wait 0.4
hold Left 0.2
wait 0.4
hold Right 0.2
wait 0.4
hold Left 0.3
wait 0.4
hold Right 2.85
hold Right Space 0.3
hold Right 0.2
hold Right 0.1
hold Right Space 0.3
wait 0.3
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right 0.3
hold Right Space 0.3
hold Right 0.2
hold Right 0.7
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right 0.3
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right 0.7
wait 0.2
hold Right 0.15
hold Right Space 200ms
